# NetForge — Tour, Guide & Journey Navigator
Date: 2026-08-28

## Features Added

### Bubble Walkthrough Tours
- TourProvider with spotlight bubbles (non-blocking overlay)
- Auto-starts welcome tour on first visit
- ? button bottom-right to replay tours (Welcome, Focus, Today)
- Keyboard: Arrow keys, Enter, Escape

### How to Use Page (`/guide`)
- Short Q&A format covering daily workflow, journey, progress, key pages
- "Take the Tour" button

### Learning Journey Navigator
- 25 milestones: Linux → OSPF → Azure → AZ-700
- Tap any milestone to jump (updates week, day, module)
- "Continue →" button for next topic
- On Dashboard, Curriculum, Accountability pages

### Improved Progress Calculation
- `getOverallProgress()` weighted score:
  - Curriculum position 20%
  - Modules 25%
  - Days 20%
  - Blocks 20%
  - Lab setup 10%
  - Drill accuracy 5%
- ProgressTracker shows breakdown (curriculum, modules, days, blocks, labs, drills)

## New Files
- lib/journey.ts, lib/tours.ts
- components/TourProvider.tsx, TourBubble.tsx, TourLauncher.tsx
- components/JourneyNavigator.tsx, AppProviders.tsx
- app/guide/page.tsx
